1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 6=

10
00:01:03,790 --> 00:01:04,910
There's talk in the palace

11
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:07,420
that Cui Hong owns
a private residence in Yongning Ward,

12
00:01:07,630 --> 00:01:09,070
where many women are being held captive.

13
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:12,580
I can use my work as a physician

14
00:01:12,830 --> 00:01:13,950
as a pretext
to investigate Yongning Ward.

15
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:16,270
No.

16
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:17,470
It's too dangerous.

17
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:20,060
We will discuss this

18
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:21,380
after I've investigated the matter.

19
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:24,540
Master.

20
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:30,980
Report!

21
00:01:31,390 --> 00:01:32,430
Most urgent dispatch!

22
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:34,500
Urgent military dispatch!

23
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:35,830
Your Majesty.

24
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:37,350
Thirty thousand cavalrymen
from the Snow Kingdom

25
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:38,540
have bypassed Tianque Pass

26
00:01:38,540 --> 00:01:39,540
and launched
a surprise attack on Lizhou.

27
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:41,180
Lizhou is in imminent danger.

28
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:43,900
They request immediate
reinforcements from the court.

29
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:48,150
(Thirty thousand cavalrymen.)

30
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:49,540
(They came sooner than expected.)

31
00:01:50,030 --> 00:01:51,220
(I can use this opportunity

32
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:54,110
(to get rid of the old grain
and medicine I've stockpiled.)

33
00:02:05,510 --> 00:02:06,180
Your Majesty.

34
00:02:06,830 --> 00:02:09,260
The Snow Kingdom's
pastures withered this summer,

35
00:02:09,540 --> 00:02:12,260
so they were bound
to raid southward this winter.

36
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:14,030
As for this matter,

37
00:02:17,110 --> 00:02:19,420
I anticipated it three months ago.

38
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:22,060
In my view,

39
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:23,310
Your Majesty,

40
00:02:24,110 --> 00:02:26,540
General Xiao Jing
has fifty thousand troops

41
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:27,700
stationed at the border,

42
00:02:27,950 --> 00:02:29,140
ready for battle at any moment.

43
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:30,310
Now

44
00:02:31,390 --> 00:02:34,780
is the time for them
to serve their country.

45
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:46,300
(Censor Zheng, Chief Censor)

46
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:52,900
Issue my decree.

47
00:02:53,750 --> 00:02:56,900
Order Xiao Jing
to lead thirty thousand troops

48
00:02:57,470 --> 00:02:58,900
and take full charge
of resisting the enemy.

49
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:03,140
All military affairs

50
00:03:03,950 --> 00:03:04,950
concerning this campaign

51
00:03:05,830 --> 00:03:09,110
shall be coordinated and overseen
by Grand Secretary Cui.

52
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:13,510
I accept the decree.

53
00:03:13,860 --> 00:03:16,460
I will not fail Your Majesty's trust.

54
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:19,980
(Just you wait, you old scoundrel.)

55
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:23,110
Medical Attendant Gu, wait.

56
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,700
What can I do for you, Madam Rong?

57
00:03:30,420 --> 00:03:31,670
I wouldn't presume to instruct you.

58
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:34,190
It's just that
Noble Consort Cui discovered

59
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:36,070
that a red gold
phoenix-tail agate hairpin

60
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:38,790
is missing from her jewelry case.

61
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:41,140
The palace maids on duty all say

62
00:03:41,950 --> 00:03:43,910
that the last person
to handle the jewelry case

63
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:46,020
was you, Medical Attendant Gu.

64
00:03:46,830 --> 00:03:48,860
I've been treating Her Highness
with acupuncture all day.

65
00:03:49,110 --> 00:03:50,300
I never went near the jewelry case.

66
00:03:50,630 --> 00:03:52,300
Just because
you say so doesn't make it true.

67
00:03:52,510 --> 00:03:53,950
We saw it with our own eyes.

68
00:03:54,510 --> 00:03:56,980
You must have stolen it
while treating Her Highness.

69
00:03:57,670 --> 00:03:58,260
Exactly.

70
00:03:58,790 --> 00:04:00,260
To clear your name,

71
00:04:00,510 --> 00:04:02,140
you should let us search you.

72
00:04:02,790 --> 00:04:04,110
If we've truly wronged you,

73
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:07,230
I'll personally serve you
tea and apologize.

74
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:18,830
- Madam Rong!
- Madam!

75
00:04:18,980 --> 00:04:21,190
Who... who are you?

76
00:04:21,190 --> 00:04:22,510
Lay a finger on her,

77
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:24,020
and you'll pay with your life.

78
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:27,580
Well, Gu Hanyi,

79
00:04:28,740 --> 00:04:30,860
you even dared to sneak
a guard into the palace.

80
00:04:32,790 --> 00:04:34,070
This isn't over.

81
00:04:34,350 --> 00:04:34,950
Madam Rong.

82
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:35,950
Let's go, Madam.

83
00:04:39,830 --> 00:04:41,670
Thank you for coming
to my rescue, Mei Qi.

84
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:43,190
She never lets a grudge go.

85
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:44,830
You must be careful from now on.

86
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:47,630
It's fine.

87
00:04:48,420 --> 00:04:49,020
We've made an enemy of her

88
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:51,070
either way.

89
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:10,220
(Mei Jiu / Haitang)

90
00:05:14,780 --> 00:05:15,990
I'll get you out of there.

91
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:39,900
Anyone who trespasses
on the hunting grounds

92
00:05:40,140 --> 00:05:40,780
dies.

93
00:05:50,550 --> 00:05:51,140
Who are you?

94
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:05,550
Drinking alone again, General?

95
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:07,390
(Xiao Jing, Great General Jingyuan)

96
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,310
How boring.

97
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:15,100
If you can keep me at a distance

98
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:18,340
and take three gemstones from me,

99
00:06:19,070 --> 00:06:22,510
I'll grant you one request.

100
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:24,260
Interesting.

101
00:06:25,340 --> 00:06:26,460
Anything at all?

102
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:27,020
Of course.

103
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:29,550
As long as you can do it.

104
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:41,700
This entire street

105
00:06:42,340 --> 00:06:43,830
has no place as heavily guarded as this.

106
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:45,780
This must be it.

107
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:49,190
Those women imprisoned by Cui Hong...

108
00:06:49,310 --> 00:06:50,460
Who knows
what they're being put through?

109
00:06:51,780 --> 00:06:52,780
I can't just leave them to die.

110
00:06:53,550 --> 00:06:55,430
Mei Qi, help me.

111
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:56,780
All right.

112
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:31,390
The first one.

113
00:07:37,990 --> 00:07:38,830
The second one.

114
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:45,900
The second one.

115
00:07:50,020 --> 00:07:51,190
The third one.

116
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:09,780
Miss,

117
00:08:10,190 --> 00:08:10,750
what's your name?

118
00:08:10,900 --> 00:08:11,660
My name is Yin Shuang.

119
00:08:12,580 --> 00:08:13,950
Why are you all being held here?

120
00:08:14,260 --> 00:08:16,580
We were drugged
and brought here while unconscious.

121
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:17,310
Cui Hong said

122
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:18,830
he would train us
to become suitable candidates

123
00:08:18,830 --> 00:08:20,550
and send us into the palace
to serve His Majesty.

124
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:21,830
What?

125
00:08:22,100 --> 00:08:23,780
Any girl who was taken away
and refused to obey

126
00:08:23,990 --> 00:08:25,140
would be brutally beaten,

127
00:08:25,780 --> 00:08:26,630
assaulted by several men,

128
00:08:26,780 --> 00:08:27,580
or even killed.

129
00:08:28,660 --> 00:08:29,020
That...

130
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:31,900
Cui Hong

131
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:33,900
is utterly inhuman.

132
00:08:35,310 --> 00:08:35,900
Don't worry.

133
00:08:36,830 --> 00:08:37,900
I promise
I'll get all of you out of here.

134
00:08:41,870 --> 00:08:42,100
Come on.

135
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:43,070
Help untie each other.

136
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:50,700
The third one.

137
00:08:53,660 --> 00:08:54,220
I concede.

138
00:08:56,900 --> 00:08:58,430
If I must lose to you,

139
00:08:59,780 --> 00:09:00,830
I couldn't be happier.

140
00:09:02,630 --> 00:09:05,140
I'm truly touched, General.

141
00:09:05,460 --> 00:09:06,430
If you're so touched,

142
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:11,340
would you be willing
to have a family with me?

143
00:09:12,340 --> 00:09:13,220
General,

144
00:09:14,460 --> 00:09:16,070
are you asking me to marry you?

145
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:18,260
If you say yes,

146
00:09:18,460 --> 00:09:19,510
I'll give you a grand wedding

147
00:09:20,390 --> 00:09:22,430
and welcome you proudly
into the Xiao family.

148
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:25,700
All right.

149
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:29,220
Then I'll put my faith in you this once.

150
00:09:34,220 --> 00:09:35,550
There's no time like the present.

151
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:40,150
Let's go!

152
00:09:45,030 --> 00:09:45,790
Trying to escape?

153
00:09:46,220 --> 00:09:46,950
In your dreams.

154
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:49,460
You two are quite the beauties.

155
00:09:49,860 --> 00:09:51,460
What a pleasant surprise to have you
walk right into our hands.

156
00:09:57,500 --> 00:09:57,950
Kill them!

157
00:09:59,430 --> 00:09:59,860
Kill them!

158
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:02,380
Hanyi.

159
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:04,150
Get them out of here.

160
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:05,790
What about you?

161
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:06,790
Go!

162
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:11,980
Hurry!

163
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:13,460
Be careful.

164
00:10:13,910 --> 00:10:14,430
Go!

165
00:10:15,310 --> 00:10:16,150
- Go!
- Go!

166
00:10:16,150 --> 00:10:16,580
Hurry!

167
00:10:16,740 --> 00:10:17,150
Get them!

168
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:18,030
- Yes!
- Yes!

169
00:10:22,860 --> 00:10:23,500
Hurry!

170
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:25,430
Go!

171
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:31,860
(Double Happiness)

172
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:50,380
(Mei Qi, please be safe.)

173
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:56,950
You're asking for death!

174
00:11:12,500 --> 00:11:12,980
What's wrong?

175
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:22,150
Haitang.

176
00:11:25,670 --> 00:11:26,070
I'm fine.

177
00:11:28,100 --> 00:11:28,670
General,

178
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:34,340
there's something
I've always wanted to ask you.

179
00:11:35,190 --> 00:11:36,580
You've won countless honors in battle,

180
00:11:37,580 --> 00:11:39,030
and there are
so many fine women in the world.

181
00:11:39,550 --> 00:11:40,860
Why did you choose me?

182
00:11:41,620 --> 00:11:43,340
Because in this vast and troubled world,

183
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:45,830
when I was at my lowest,

184
00:11:47,310 --> 00:11:48,460
you were the only one

185
00:11:49,070 --> 00:11:50,700
willing to dirty your hands

186
00:11:51,220 --> 00:11:51,980
to pull me back from the brink.

187
00:11:56,980 --> 00:11:59,020
(Cui Residence)

188
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:00,100
Enjoy your meal, Master.

189
00:12:04,340 --> 00:12:04,670
Sir.

190
00:12:05,220 --> 00:12:06,620
Last night, Gu Hanyi broke into
the secondary residence with others

191
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:08,310
and rescued those women.

192
00:12:09,070 --> 00:12:10,030
Very well.

193
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:13,852
She brought down Zhao Wujiu

194
00:12:13,852 --> 00:12:15,440
as soon as she entered
the Imperial Medical Service,

195
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:18,380
and now she dares meddle
in my private residence.

196
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:21,880
Gu Hanyi.

197
00:12:22,850 --> 00:12:25,300
Since you're determined
to make an enemy of me,

198
00:12:26,100 --> 00:12:27,580
I'll show you

199
00:12:28,220 --> 00:12:30,310
what happens
when the powerless challenge the mighty.

200
00:12:31,070 --> 00:12:32,430
You're only bringing ruin upon yourself.

201
00:12:49,970 --> 00:12:52,830
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

202
00:12:53,590 --> 00:12:56,530
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

203
00:12:57,190 --> 00:13:00,010
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

204
00:13:00,860 --> 00:13:03,850
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

205
00:13:04,700 --> 00:13:08,020
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

206
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:11,650
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

207
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:18,480
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

208
00:13:19,270 --> 00:13:26,360
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

209
00:13:28,860 --> 00:13:36,710
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

210
00:13:37,010 --> 00:13:38,820
♪I stand here today♪

211
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:43,470
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

212
00:13:43,470 --> 00:13:50,960
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

213
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,890
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

214
00:13:52,890 --> 00:13:55,290
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

215
00:13:55,730 --> 00:14:02,580
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
